      "content": "it's not just a \"new chapter\" though. you don't get a new chapter when the main character is gone. the person who actually lived, who actually felt alive... they aren't coming back. it feels like i'm just a placeholder for someone who's already dead. how am i supposed to \"rebuild\" when the foundation is just gone? it feels like a joke.",
